<title>USA: FGIC qualifies $100 mln NYC bonds for FGIC - bid.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies $100 mln NYC bonds for FGIC - bid.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co said Wednesday it qualified $100 million of New York City general obligation bonds under the firm's FGIC-Bid secondary market insurance program.</p>
<p>An official FGIC-Bid form appeared in Wednesday's Blue List of secondary market offerings.</p>
<p>Bids should be faxed to 212-312-3011 by 1300 EST.  </p>
<p>For more information, call 212-312-3020 or 800-446-FGIC.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
